  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2012-03-28",
   "text": "Death Tax Repeal Permanency Act of 2012 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to: (1) repeal the estate and generation-skipping transfer taxes, and (2) make permanent the maximum 35% gift tax rate and a $5 million lifetime gift tax exemption."
  }
